# Ghostty theme matching the xeno.nvim "xeno-cyberpunk-v2" colorscheme,
# adapted from kitty/xeno-cyberpunk-v2.conf (kitty's theme, not the
# current nvim colorscheme file directly -- see that file's comment for
# the values this is derived from).
#
# background #0b0d10, accent (neon yellow-green) #e8e34a
# teal #089ED9, green #7EA929, indigo #7E4AE6, magenta #F11FCB

